:"plan","approve":true,"bead_id":"sase-l3.1","changespec_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","cl_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","clan_summary":"[bold #D75FFF]◆ EPIC sase-l3[/bold #D75FFF]\n[dim]  Title: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]Grok Build LLM provider[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]SASE gains a first-class `grok` LLM provider driving xAI's Grok [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]Build CLI, supported everywhere the existing providers are — [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]invocation, streaming text, reasoning pane, Tools panel, usage/cost[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]accounting, doctor, agent-cli inventory and updates, model routing,[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]skill deployment, TUI theming, and docs — with tool rows and [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]reasoning that render as richly as Claude's rather than degrading [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]to opaque key lists.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]8[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]6[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202608/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]grok_provider.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202608/grok_provider.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-l3[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-l3/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Provider-neutral Messages-wire stream layer[/bold #D7AFFF]                   [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]wire[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]wire: generalize the Claude stream-json parser into a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]provider-parameterized Anthropic-Messages reader — runtime tagging, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`errors[]` diagnostics, a thinking-block sink, and a pluggable tool-call[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]writer seam — leaving 